OL,3,GNEWSAYoung Hero: Saif Mubarak nominated
OL,4,Afor BBC award
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaif Mubarak is a 10-year-old boy from
OL,7,FLondon.
OL,9,FIn the past five years he has survived
OL,10,Fcancer, had a leg amputated, and
OL,11,Fexperienced the death of his father.
OL,13,FNow he helps and inspires others in
OL,14,Fsimilar situations - and has been
OL,15,Fnominated in the Young Hero category of
OL,16,Fthe BBC Make a Difference Awards.
OL,18,FMy name is Saif and I'm 10 years old
OL,19,Fand I survived osteosarcoma.
